flowchart LR
    A[Prompt text] --> B[Tokenize]
    B --> C[Token + positional embeddings]
    C --> D[Transformer block x N]
    D --> E["Self-attention: softmax(QK^T / sqrt d) V"]
    E --> F[Feed-forward + residual + norm]
    F --> D
    D --> G[Final logits over vocab]
    G --> H[Decode: greedy / top-p / temperature]
    H --> I[Next token]
    I -->|append, repeat| A
    D -.cache.-> J[KV cache for fast decoding]
